  "title": "Inca Garcilaso de la Vega",
  "summary": "Inca Garcilaso de la Vega, born Gómez Suárez de Figueroa in Cuzco in 1539 to a Spanish captain and an Inca princess, sailed to Spain in 1560 and never returned. He wrote the Comentarios Reales de los Incas, whose first part appeared in 1609 and second in 1617, after his death in 1616.",
